        "gmNotes": "<p><strong>Example: Infiltration.</strong> Built for four level-4 PCs. Base DC 19, level 4's DC.</p><p>The party breaks into the saltworks at night to copy the foreman's ledger. Rounds are about one minute. Each obstacle is revealed when the party reaches it.</p><p><strong>Each roll:</strong> a success gives the obstacle 1 Infiltration Point and a critical success 2. A failure adds 1 Awareness Point and a critical failure 2. Mark the obstacle Complete when it is full, and reveal the next.</p><p><strong>The Outer Fence</strong> is an individual obstacle: each PC needs 1 point. Its counter is per PC.</p><p><strong>Complications:</strong> the Night Clerk and the Dock Dog start hidden. Reveal each when its Awareness tier is reached.</p><p><strong>Edge Points:</strong> type in what each PC earned in Before the Saltworks.</p>",
